   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xf6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim is to improve the living conditions of minority Roma families by resettlement of 32 Roma families from cottages in Butmir Sarajevo to 8 new housing locations. This is the test of the possibilities of implementation of housing action plan, in close cooperation with and co-financed by the local authorities.</narrative>
